---
// Tech Stack & Differentiators Component
---
<section class="section stack-section" id="stack">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">Stack y Diferenciadores</div>
      <h2 class="section-title split-title">Tecnología de vanguardia,<br />resultados reales</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stack-layout">
      <div class="stack-cats" id="stackCats">
        <div class="scat">
          <h4 class="scat-title">Frontend</h4>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">React</span><span class="sbadge">Next.js 15</span><span class="sbadge">Vue 3</span><span class="sbadge">Nuxt</span><span class="sbadge">Astro</span><span class="sbadge">TypeScript</span><span class="sbadge">GSAP</span><span class="sbadge">Framer Motion</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scat">
          <h4 class="scat-title">Backend</h4>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">Node.js</span><span class="sbadge">Python</span><span class="sbadge">Go</span><span class="sbadge">Spring Boot</span><span class="sbadge">FastAPI</span><span class="sbadge">GraphQL</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scat">
          <h4 class="scat-title">Cloud y DevOps</h4>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">AWS</span><span class="sbadge">GCP</span><span class="sbadge">Docker</span><span class="sbadge">Kubernetes</span><span class="sbadge">Terraform</span><span class="sbadge">GitHub Actions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scat">
          <h4 class="scat-title">Base de Datos</h4>
          <div class="scat-badges">
            <span class="sbadge">PostgreSQL</span><span class="sbadge">MongoDB</span><span class="sbadge">Redis</span><span class="sbadge">Supabase</span><span class="sbadge">Prisma</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="guarantees" id="guarantees">
        <div class="gcard tilt-card">
          <div class="gcard-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
          <h4 class="gcard-title">Código Escalable</h4>
          <p class="gcard-desc">Arquitecturas limpias, documentadas y probadas que escalan de 1 a 1,000,000 usuarios sin refactoring mayor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gcard tilt-card">
          <div class="gcard-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></div>
          <h4 class="gcard-title">Diseño que Convierte</h4>
          <p class="gcard-desc">Cada decisión de diseño está respaldada por datos. A/B testing, heatmaps y optimización continua de la experiencia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gcard tilt-card">
          <div class="gcard-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M18.36 6.64a9 9 0 1 1-12.73 0"/><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg></div>
          <h4 class="gcard-title">Soporte Continuo</h4>
          <p class="gcard-desc">Monitoreo 24/7, actualizaciones de seguridad y evolución constante de tu producto más allá del lanzamiento.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
